  {
    "file": "political-youth-v72.jpg",
    "title": "File:3 1 0 17 12337 34303 Hitlerjugend HJ Hitler Youth celebration 1933-06-11 drummers on parade Regional Deutsches Jungvolk Siegrune banners paramilitary uniforms Narodowe Archiwum Cyfrowe Public domain.jpg",
    "source": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d3/3_1_0_17_12337_34303_Hitlerjugend_HJ_Hitler_Youth_celebration_1933-06-11_drummers_on_parade_Regional_Deutsches_Jungvolk_Siegrune_banners_paramilitary_uniforms_Narodowe_Archiwum_Cyfrowe_Public_domain.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
    "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:3_1_0_17_12337_34303_Hitlerjugend_HJ_Hitler_Youth_celebration_1933-06-11_drummers_on_parade_Regional_Deutsches_Jungvolk_Siegrune_banners_paramilitary_uniforms_Narodowe_Archiwum_Cyfrowe_Public_domain.jpg",
    "metadata": {
      "DateTime": {
        "value": "2025-10-29 20:57:45",
        "source": "mediawiki-metadata",
        "hidden": ""
      },
      "ObjectName": {
        "value": "3 1 0 17 12337 34303 Hitlerjugend HJ Hitler Youth celebration 1933-06-11 drummers on parade Regional Deutsches Jungvolk Siegrune banners paramilitary uniforms Narodowe Archiwum Cyfrowe Public domain",
        "source": "mediawiki-metadata"
      },
      "CommonsMetadataExtension": {
        "value": 1.2,
        "source": "extension",
        "hidden": ""
      },
      "Categories": {
        "value": "People of Germany in 1933|Fanfarenzug|Siegrune|Jungvolk|Tenor drums|PD Old|Nazi symbols|Photographs taken on 1933-06-11|CC-PD-Mark|Images from Narodowe Archiwum Cyfrowe|June 1933 in Berlin|Boys of Germany in the 1930s|Nazi rallies|Drummer boys|Jungvolk - flags|Jungvolk - uniforms",
        "source": "commons-categories",
        "hidden": ""
      },
      "Assessments": {
        "value": "",
        "source": "commons-categories",
        "hidden": ""
      },
      "ImageDescription": {
        "value": "<b>Hitler Youth Rally (<i>Treffen der Hitlerjugend</i>), Grunewald Stadium, Berlin, June 11, 1933.</b>\n<ul><li>Drummer boys lining up with their <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/tenor_drum\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:tenor drum\">tenor drums</a> during a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nazi_propaganda\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Nazi propaganda\">Nazi propaganda</a> mass rally at the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gr%C3%BCnwalder_Stadion\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Gr\u00fcnwalder Stadion\">Gr\u00fcnwalder Stadion</a> (<i>Grunewald-Stadion</i>, today <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deutsches_Stadion_(Berlin)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Deutsches Stadion (Berlin)\">Deutsches Stadion</a>) in Berlin in the summer of 1933.</li></ul>\n<dl><dd>The young boys are wearing paramilitary, scout-like \"<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/brownshirt\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:brownshirt\">brownshirt</a>\" uniforms of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hitler_Youth\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Hitler Youth\">Hitler Youth</a> (<i><a href=\"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hitlerjugend\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"de:Hitlerjugend\">Hitlerjugend</a></i>, HJ) or the younger boys\u2019 section, the <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deutsches_Jungvolk\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Deutsches Jungvolk\">Deutsches Jungvolk</a></i> (DJ). Behind them are regional banners displaying the DJ organization\u2019s <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siegrune\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Siegrune\">Siegrune</a> emblem.</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd>Propaganda Minister <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joseph_Goebbels\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Joseph Goebbels\">Joseph Goebbels</a> and Reich Youth Leader <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baldur_von_Schirach\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Baldur von Schirach\">Baldur von Schirach</a> addressed 50,000 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hitler_Youth\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Hitler Youth\">Hitler Youth</a> members from Berlin and Brandenburg. Goebbels praised the youth\u2019s role in shaping the state, emphasized discipline, loyalty, and devotion to National Socialism, and compared the movement to Mussolini\u2019s fascist youth training. Von Schirach honored fallen members and stressed the ongoing duty of German youth to the nation.</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd>See <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://digital.slub-dresden.de/werkansicht/dlf/699814/1\"><i>S\u00e4chsische Elbzeitung</i>, Monday, June 12, 1933</a></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><b>Photo agency:</b> Keystone View Company Berlin SW 68 Zimmerstrasse 29</li>\n<li><b>Source/collection:</b> Part of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Narodowe_Archiwum_Cyfrowe\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Narodowe Archiwum Cyfrowe\">Narodowe Archiwum Cyfrowe</a> (National Digital Archives of Poland), tagged as <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/public_domain\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:public domain\">public domain</a>.</li></ul>",
        "source": "commons-desc-page"
      },
